  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring the Food, Energy, Finance Crisis towards Informed Policy and Response Options in the Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the UN Joint SDG Fund, FAO, ILO and WFP aim to work with the Government of the Philippines to (1) craft an improved and integrated monitoring framework to enhance data collection, analysis and information dissemination on the impacts of the global crisis; (2) provide policy options and risk mitigating actions, especially in the areas of food security and social protection, and (3) prepare the institutional mechanism that will potentially carry forward  streamline the monitoring and reporting work.</narrative>
  </description>
